},
{
"key": "part07.html#378",
"zh": "<span class=\"ph-id\">P07-AR-GLASS</span><span class=\"ph-icon\"></span>\n        <span class=\"ph-desc\"><b>AR眼镜 — 眼前的翻译字幕</b>咖啡馆里戴着纤薄智能眼镜的人，镜片上有微弱的字幕光</span>"
},
{
"key": "part07.html#379",
